WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Eight blue counters. Seven orange counters.
How many spaces are empty in the first frame?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Move two orange counters to fill the first ten.
How many stay in the second frame?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Ten plus five equals fifteen.
What moved? Why did the total stay the same?
